  },
  {
   "id": "bumballon-190027@post-2022-01-12",
   "gameId": "bumballon-190027",
   "displayName": "Updating Ballon's kingdom.",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2022-01-12T03:16:03.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello guys. This week I worked hard to correct some important details for the gameplay. Also, I decided to add a really cool feature that I'll list below for you guys.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1 - This update removed the save slot 2.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2 - A gallery was added that show ideas and several drafts I made during the creation of Bumballon on paper. If you love to know a little more behind the scenes I'm sure you'll really like this feature.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To have access to the gallery it is necessary to finish the game to unlock.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3 - You can now also change the difficulty of the game by accessing the options menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4 - You can now return to the title screen menu by the new quick access buttons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5 - A minor correction has been made to the collision of the world's last level Crystal Garden.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6 - In this new update the soundtrack is totally original. In addition the level completion sound effect has also been replaced to match the music of each world.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7 - A new achievement has been added when you unlock the gallery.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8 - Improved navigation buttons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you, everyone. :D",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
